rey","Kristi Lauren","Dan Pfau","Romy Reiner","Nate Smith","Galvin Chapman","Jay Evans","Thomas Mills","Johanna Stein","James Garlin","Vachik Mangassarian","Santina Muha","Bob Glouberman","Jeanne Chinn","Richard Penn","Rick Hall","Matt Champagne","Elizabeth O'Donnell","Bill Hader","Chris Witaske","Chase Kim","Lily Collins","Matt Walsh","Melanie Minichino","Gil Ozeri","Helen Siff","Johnno Wilson","Keisuke Hoashi","Jamison Yang","Bruce Katzman","Beth Tapper","Merrick McCartha","Karen Bankhead","Jonathan Bray","Will McLaughlin","Rich Eisen","Deedee Magno","Sean Clements","Steven Pierce","Kevin Ruf","Peter Grosz","Susan Mackin","Michael Luwoye","Michael C. McCarthy","Lateefah Holder","Suzanne Kent","Charlie Hartsock","Savannah Guthrie","Joe Liss","John Hartman","Harper Roisman","Andy Hirsch","Sarah Chaney","Wayne Federman","Lydia Cornell","Roman Arabia","Kelli McNeil","Brett Paesel","Kiara Muhammad","Eliza Shin","Barry Gordon","Brandon Wardell","Doug Benson","Lin-Manuel Miranda","Brad Abrell","Andy Goldberg","Rachel Crane","Jeff Kahn","Patrick Faucette","Lela Lee","Tunisia Hardison","Ashli Auguillard","Drew Powell","Sharlto Copley","Kalilah Harris","Kali Rocha","Mitch Rouse","Natalie Britton","Adam Lustick","Mary Sohn","Adam Feil","Bruce Springsteen","Willie Geist","Jon Reep","Lionel Boyce","Jason Sims-Prewitt","Cean Houston","Sienna Miller","Troy Kotsur","Matthew Jones","Hannah Rose May","Christopher Nicholas Smith","Annie Mumolo","Rob Brownstein","Rob Riggle","Colton Dunn","Anna Osceola","Doreen Calderon","Tom Schulman","Essence Atkins","Moshe Kasher","Arabella Field","Sarah Baker","Patrick Gallo","Trevor Einhorn","Lori Loughlin","Ike Barinholtz","Hymnson Chan","Craig Bierko","Matt Oberg","Cinda Adams","Sean Hayes","Dan Levy","Stephanie Styles","Emily McEnroe","Allison Jones","Dorian Frankel","Steve Buscemi","Marc Hirschfeld","Henry Hall","Laura Krafft","Greg Schaffer","Gita Isak","Katheryn McGaffigan","Travis Guba","George Paez","Dan Abrams","Mark DeCarlo","David Moreland","Shylo Shaner","Charles Kim","Chip Chinery","Collin Christopher","Nelson Ascencio","Benito Skinner","Emily Walker","Zach Reino","Nate Jackson","Mary Gillis","James Downey","Nancy Truman","Emily Buntyn","Susan Griffiths","Paul Lieber","Tony Noto","Katy Fullan","Paul Goebel","Anthony S. Johnson"],"screenwriters":["Larry David","Alec Berg","David Mandel"],"cinematographers":["Bradley Sellers","Patrick Alexander Stewart","Bill Sheehy"],"composers":["Aaron Kaplan"],"reviews":[{"author":"movie","text":"Takze sem se konecně dostal přes první sérii (a ufff, ještě 6 dalších) a sem fanoušek! CURB YOUR ENTHUSIASM je přesně můj šálek kafe. Pomalej, suchej a nenápadnej humor pomalu gradující celou epizodou. Prvních pár dílů mi trvalo se do toho dostat, a skutečně, nečekejte žádnou řachandu servírující jeden vtip za druhým minutu po minutě, CYE si pomalu buduje prostředí a vybalí karty až v závěru. Doporučuju pokud máte rádi trochu jiný \"humor\".(07.08.2011)","stars":5},{"author":"haluska11","text":"Délka seriálu může odradit, ale Larry David si ji absolutně zaslouží. Dokonalé zobrazení jak člověka, který bez bariér říká to, co nás všechny napadá v těch nejobyčejnějších momentech, tak bojovníka za sociální spravedlnost v nejabsurdnějších maličkostech. Ztotožnitelné momenty každodenní trapnosti v životě úspěšného charismatického staříka (a občas vcelku kreténa) mi přirostly k srdci obzvlášť po shlédnutí jeho sitcomu Seinfeld (bez něj jedna série pozbývá na kouzlu). \n\n\nRoztřesená kamera, improvizované dialogy a perfektní hudba navíc dokonale umocňují atmosféru právě oné každodenní trapnosti a trapné každodennosti. Ze soundtracku se dokonce stal prvek ve skvostných memech - pokud je znáte a líbí se vám, určitě dejte seriálu šanci.(02.05.2021)","stars":5},{"author":"Oralfabet","text":"V průběhu třetí série jsem si uvědomil, že nemá smysl hodnotit každou sérii zvlášť, protože je mi už celkem jasný, že bych všem dal plnej počet. Tohle je moje krevní skupina. Z nástrah sociálních interakcí asi těží většina sitcomů, ale žádný takovým způsobem jako Curb. Takhle kreativní proplétání dějových linek jsem viděl naposledy v Arrested Development, ale tady je to skoro v každé epizodě. Larry David je génius a pokud se někdy kouknu na Seinfelda, bude tomu tak nejspíš kvůli tomuhle seriálu. Btw... Odpad od LIVINGDEADa byl jako vždy skvělým doporučením.(28.05.2021)","stars":5}],"vods":[{"platform":"HBO Max","url":"https://www.hbomax.com/cz/en/shows/curb-your-enthusiasm/18a0993f-209a-4653-8f94-f3fb8422e678"},{"platform":"Lepší.TV","url":"https://www.lepsi.tv/top_tv/serial/larry-krot-se-online?utm_source=csfd&utm_content=csfd"}],"link":"https://www.csfd.cz/film/136236-larry-krot-se/prehled/","csfd_id":136236,"root_id":136236,"root_title_id":null,"root_title":null,"root_slug":null,"is_toplevel":true,"season_no":null,"episode_no":null,"season_count":12,"episode_count":120,"is_running":false,"cadence_days":7,"first_vod_date":"2021-10-24","last_vod_date":"2024-04-07","episodes":[{"season_no":11,"episode_no":1,"vod_date":"2021-10-24","title":"Jedenapůlmetrový plot (S11E01)","platforms":["HBO Max"]},{"season_no":11,"episode_no":2,"vod_date":"2021-10-31","title":"Mufinka (S11E02)","platforms":["HBO Max"]},{"season_no":11,"episode_no":3,"vod_date":"2021-11-07","title":"Minibar (S11E03)","platforms":["HBO Max"]},{"season_no":11,"episode_no":4,"vod_date":"2021-11-14","title":"Meloun (S11E04)","platforms":["HBO Max"]},{"season_no":11,"episode_no":5,"vod_date":"2021-11-21","title":"Tajemství (S11E05)","platforms":["HBO Max"]},{"season_no":11,"episode_no":6,"vod_date":"2021-11-28","title":"Souboj s malou ženou (S11E06)","platforms":["HBO Max"]},{"season_no":11,"episode_no":7,"vod_date":"2021-12-05","title":"Irma Kostroská (S11E07)","platforms":["HBO Max"]},{"season_no":11,"episode_no":8,"vod_date":"2021-12-12","title":"Co jsem to proved? (S11E08)","platforms":["HBO Max"]},{"season_no":11,"episode_no":9,"vod_date":"2021-12-19","title":"Igor, Gregor a Timor (S11E09)